<title>GERMANY: Mannesmann surges on telecom hopes.</title>
<headline>Mannesmann surges on telecom hopes.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German engineering group Mannesmann AG surged two percent in pre-bourse trade on Thursday on hopes that the group was set to further commit itself to its growing telecom business.</p>
<p>Shares in the company rose 13.5 marks to 657.50 in electronic trade, just before the official start of bourse trade.</p>
<p>Mannesmann is holding a news conference to outline strategy for its Arcor communications venture with the Germany railway, formerly known as DBKom.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
